    "created_at": "2018-09-13T15:06:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-13T15:07:09Z",
    "body": "This only reports if the second check fails, but presumably it should also report when the first check fails?\r\n\r\nCould we bake reporting into \"allowed to use\" and suppress it the few times it should not happen? That might make it less likely to be overlooked.",
