    "created_at": "2018-09-17T08:03:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-17T08:03:15Z",
    "body": "@clelland how will you implement this? Will the checking and the reporting be entirely separate, will there be a flag to the check that says whether to report, or something else? Unless it's convoluted by implementation details that don't matter at the spec level, a similar structure in the spec might make sense.",
