    "created_at": "2018-09-17T15:07:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-09-17T15:07:39Z",
    "body": "The current implementation in Chrome has an `IsFeatureEnabled()` method which takes a bool that determines whether to report immediately on failure or not. There's also a separate `ReportFeaturePolicyViolation` method that can be called on its own if that's needed. Then it's up to the call sites for each feature to decide whether a failure is a reportable violation or not.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
