    "updated_at": "2018-09-18T12:50:08Z",
    "body": "Sounds like a reasonable structure, yeah. @clelland, in this case, would the reporting be implicit or explicit? Seems to me given the structure that making it implicit in the check is the way to make sure a violation is only reported when that's the real reason fullscreen failed?",
